<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#F5F7FA',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 36 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 5, paddingTop: 8 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2, marginBottom: 10 }}>TRANSFORMER</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.35, marginBottom: 16 }}>
        Transformer：<br />答题时圈重点的注意力机制
      </Text>
      <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, background: '#22D3EE', marginBottom: 22 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.8, marginBottom: 22 }}>
        读题时你会<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F' }}>圈出关键词</span>再作答——Transformer 的「注意力」就是这个过程：让模型知道一句话里<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F' }}>哪些词最重要</span>。
      </Text>

      <Box style={{ background: '#16263F', borderRadius: 14, padding: '24px 28px' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginBottom: 14 }}>
          <FAIcon name='brain' style={{ fill: '#FF9F1C', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>一句话记牢</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>
          自注意力 = 每个词都问一遍「整句话里，谁和我最相关」，然后把重点信息「加权」到自己身上。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 4, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: 18, boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Image
        src='assets/transformer_attention.png'
        style={{ width: '100%', height: 370, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 12, marginBottom: 18 }}
      />
      <Box style={{ background: '#EAF2FB', borderRadius: 12, padding: '16px 18px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 6 }}>看图理解：注意力就是「圈重点」</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
          发光的关键行获得更高权重；Q / K / V 的数学细节见 P11 选学页。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 60, right: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>AI 从零开始 · 第 1 讲</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>04 / 11</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
